    "name": "Element5 Authorization Eligibility API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Element5 APIs enables the clients to invoke and monitor Element5 Workflows. The E5 APIs are protected by API keys and the keys would be shared during the onboarding process. Due to the long running nature of workflows the current state of the workflows can be tracked either by polling E5 APIs for status or exposing a webhook which will be notified about progress. The below sections highlight the APIs and events which would be relevant for the current engagement.\n\n# Authentication\n\n<!-- ReDoc-Inject: <security-definitions> -->\n\nContact Support:\n Email: apisupport@e5.ai",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
